  "body": "This is a followup to #139.\n\nUnder the [\"To create a HID report item\"](https://hid.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-creating-a-hid-report-item) section, steps 13 is:\n> 13. Set reportItem[\"[usages](https://hid.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-hidreportitem-usages)\"] to usages.\n\nBut usages only makes sense if we are not using a range. So I think we should move this step past the calculation of `reportItem[\"isRange\"]` and change it to something like\n\n31. If `reportItem[\"isRange\"]` is false, set `reportItem[\"usages\"]` to `usages`.",
